# Avatar size (in-play)

- Shared default: `--fc-avatar-inplay: 90px` in `public/games/shared-player-theme.css`.
- **New games must use that default.** Do not set a smaller `--fc-avatar-inplay` on a game board.
- Overlay / takeover avatars use `--fc-avatar-overlay: 140px` (also shared).
- Six-player layouts (Demolition, Derby, Harper Wins, etc.) already fit 90px — do not shrink “to make room.”
- If a board needs a rare exception, ask the user first; never silently override.
